50/extras/2096c9d35800fca9a7d60fe5aca84bb3.mp4?t=1752871747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create</strong>\u00a0your own levels. Use a simple to use level editor that offers all the features found in the main game. Switch seamlessly between different worlds when designing your level, and place decorations to your heart's content. <strong>Download and upload</strong> levels, enabling level sharing between friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874850/extras/9de23c1887f4edbc6b3da1d9583477f3.avif?t=1752871747\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874850/extras/cc67f23c61757388d8eceaf75a5cac3a.poster.avif?t=1752871747\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874850/extras/cc67f23c61757388d8eceaf75a5cac3a.webm?t=1752871747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874850/extras/cc67f23c61757388d8eceaf75a5cac3a.mp4?t=1752871747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve</strong>\u00a0intriguing puzzles. Not every level is linear: sometimes <strong>levels branch off</strong> which requires problem solving to figure out where you are and how to find the ending. Some levels offer <strong>puzzles</strong> which reward the player with collectibles that can help you complete the level or buy fun hats.</p>","developers":["Charger Jack Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets